WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.409 --> 00:00:02.329
I'm here at the Berlin
Tempelhof Airport.

00:00:02.329 --> 00:00:05.428
This is an iconic site,
one of the most famous

00:00:05.428 --> 00:00:06.768
airports in the world.

00:00:06.768 --> 00:00:09.142
It was the scene of the Berlin Airlift,

00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:10.975
between 1948 and 1949,

00:00:12.224 --> 00:00:15.196
Berlin was cut off from
the rest of the world,

00:00:15.196 --> 00:00:17.696
and this city was fed by the West.

00:00:17.696 --> 00:00:21.731
Planes landed here every 30 to 45 seconds

00:00:21.731 --> 00:00:24.324
to bring valuable food, medical supplies,

00:00:24.324 --> 00:00:26.742
and it helped save West Berlin.

00:00:26.742 --> 00:00:29.579
Tempelhof is again playing a pivotal role,

00:00:29.579 --> 00:00:33.657
because right now 1,500
refugees are living here,

00:00:33.657 --> 00:00:37.407
refugees from Afghanistan,
Syria, Iraq, Iran,

00:00:39.213 --> 00:00:43.380
so many hoping to either go
back one day to their own homes,

00:00:44.575 --> 00:00:46.327
where it will be peaceful and safe,

00:00:46.327 --> 00:00:48.929
or, possibly, to assimilate.

00:00:48.929 --> 00:00:51.624
So, I want to go in,
I want to talk to them

00:00:51.624 --> 00:00:54.041
and find out what's going on.

00:00:56.460 --> 00:00:58.460
Hello, my name is Conan.

00:00:59.635 --> 00:01:01.923
Where are you from?

00:01:01.923 --> 00:01:03.315
Palestine.

00:01:03.315 --> 00:01:04.663
You're from Syria.

00:01:04.663 --> 00:01:06.663
What are you studying?

00:01:08.306 --> 00:01:10.267
Could you see yourself
living here in Germany,

00:01:10.267 --> 00:01:11.350
do you think?

00:01:23.314 --> 00:01:26.452
I'm standing here with
gentlemen from Afghanistan.

00:01:26.452 --> 00:01:30.663
How long have you been here, at Tempelhof?

00:01:30.663 --> 00:01:31.496
And what do they do while

00:01:31.496 --> 00:01:33.663
they're here at Tempelhof?

00:01:35.891 --> 00:01:38.022
Could you ask them
if there is one message

00:01:38.022 --> 00:01:40.253
they would like to get out to the world,

00:01:40.253 --> 00:01:41.836
what would that be?

00:01:51.649 --> 00:01:53.439
The good news is that most people,

00:01:53.439 --> 00:01:56.033
in their hearts, understand that.

00:01:56.033 --> 00:01:58.247
Is their hope to one day go home

00:01:58.247 --> 00:02:00.414
to a peaceful Afghanistan?

00:02:03.557 --> 00:02:06.280
It's interesting because
they're living in a city now,

00:02:06.280 --> 00:02:09.921
Berlin, that was completely
destroyed by war,

00:02:09.921 --> 00:02:12.171
and yet this city grew back

00:02:13.784 --> 00:02:15.409
and is more vibrant,

00:02:15.409 --> 00:02:18.223
stronger, more diverse, than ever,

00:02:18.223 --> 00:02:20.849
and I think that would be
a bright message of hope

00:02:20.849 --> 00:02:22.720
to people from Afghanistan.

00:02:22.720 --> 00:02:24.565
So what's your favorite sport?

00:02:24.565 --> 00:02:26.113
I'm an amazing dancer.

00:02:26.113 --> 00:02:28.514
When I dance, all the
women fall in love with me.

00:02:28.514 --> 00:02:29.954
Why is he laughing?

00:02:29.954 --> 00:02:32.000
He doesn't believe me.

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:33.028
You don't believe me, do you?

00:02:33.028 --> 00:02:35.111
(laughs)

00:02:37.068 --> 00:02:38.661
See that?

00:02:38.661 --> 00:02:40.124
Pretty good huh?

00:02:40.124 --> 00:02:42.624
That's it, guys, let's try it.

00:02:44.135 --> 00:02:46.367
Hey look at that, I like that!

00:02:46.367 --> 00:02:47.200
Yes!

00:02:50.249 --> 00:02:51.082
Important question:

00:02:51.082 --> 00:02:55.165
Is everyone else jealous
of his amazing mustache?

00:02:57.278 --> 00:02:58.116
You want that mustache?

00:02:58.116 --> 00:02:59.283
You want that?

00:03:01.464 --> 00:03:03.095
With the magic of television,

00:03:03.095 --> 00:03:04.427
I can give you that mustache,

00:03:04.427 --> 00:03:08.025
if you look right at
that camera right now.

00:03:08.025 --> 00:03:09.003
See!

00:03:09.003 --> 00:03:12.064
(bell rings)

00:03:12.064 --> 00:03:14.085
Congratulations.

00:03:14.085 --> 00:03:17.002
(upbeat pop music)

00:03:25.218 --> 00:03:26.552
Aaagh!

00:03:26.552 --> 00:03:27.385
Gah!

00:03:30.220 --> 00:03:31.954
Ha ha ha ha ha!

00:03:31.954 --> 00:03:32.787
Gah!

00:03:34.522 --> 00:03:36.022
You guys are mean!

00:03:41.447 --> 00:03:42.280
Yay!

